		{"id":"workspace-instructions","type":"text","x":0,"y":-360,"width":1230,"height":260,"text":"# Settlements · Rulebook layout\n\nDrag a **note card** into another chapter group: its centre determines its **Planned section**. The table and boards read the same property. Moving a card outside chapter groups leaves its assignment unchanged.\n\nUse **Canvas: Jump to group** to navigate chapters, then zoom in. Double-click a card to edit its live Summary; open the note to read its full rule.\n\n**Ctrl+P → Settlements Rule Workspace: Add a new rule card** creates an indexed draft.\n\n[[Rule Cards - Visual Workspace|Table, boards and instructions]] · [[Settlements Rulebook Layout.base|Placement table / Moved cards]]\n\nThese are proposed chapter placements. Within-chapter positions do not yet set manuscript order; deferred material remains deferred."},
